<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-ecuador"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Ecuador.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Ecuador</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Oil exports begin through the Trans-Ecuadorian pipeline</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/united-arab-emirates"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/United%20Arab%20Emirates.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>United Arab Emirates</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Ras al-Khaimah joins as the seventh emirate</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/uganda"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Uganda.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Uganda</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Amin expels the country’s Asian community</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/rhodesia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Rhodesia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Rhodesia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">On 21 December ZANLA insurgents under Rex Nhongo cross from Mozambique and raid a commercial farm, opening the raids on white farmers across the north-east.</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/environmental-movement"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Environmental%20movement.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Environmental movement</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The international environmental conference in Stockholm is held</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/rosetta-stone"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Rosetta%20Stone.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Rosetta Stone</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">It left the museum for one month to be shown at the Louvre beside Champollion's Lettre</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/kwame-nkrumah"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kwame%20Nkrumah.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kwame Nkrumah</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Nkrumah dies in Bucharest, after years of exile in Guinea</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/cyrus-cylinder"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Cyrus%20Cylinder.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Cyrus Cylinder</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Fragments A and B were reunited at the British Museum</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/the-art-of-war"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/The%20Art%20of%20War.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>The Art of War</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Yinqueshan Han slips are discovered in the two tombs near Linyi</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/american-indian-movement"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/American%20Indian%20Movement.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>American Indian Movement</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Trail of Broken Treaties ends in the occupation of the Bureau of Indian Affairs headquarters, where the Twenty Points are publicised</span></li></ul></section>
